          "definition": "n. 停電、斷訊、服務中斷（水電或網路供應暫停）"
        }
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "A sudden power outage forced the factory to halt production for three hours.",
          "highlight": [
            "outage"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "一場突如其來的停電迫使工廠停工三小時。"
          }
