          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "近期風暴造成的多起停電，讓數個社區整晚沒有電力。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "The IT team monitors every outage and publishes a post-mortem within 24 hours.",
          "highlight": [
            "outage"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "IT 團隊監控每一次服務中斷，並在 24 小時內發布事後檢討報告。"
          }
